        body: "Candidates in cross-border processes are navigating a more complex set of dynamics than in a domestic search. They are being assessed by stakeholders with different cultural frameworks for what good leadership looks like. They are often interviewing with people who have limited direct exposure to India and who may be applying mental models that are more appropriate to their home markets.",
